A step in the ${fref("/programming-language-theory/concepts/compiler.td")} that involves converting texts into sequences of ${fref("/programming-language-theory/concepts/token.td")}s. This typically involves:

- Removing comments and whitespaces.
- Categorizing tokens.

The process of classifying texts into syntactic categories.
